# This repo hosts pipeline CODE plus small (<10MB) external inputs under
# metadata/raw_external/ -- never the benchmark archive itself (deposited
# separately after publication, see ARCHIVE_BUILD.md). Guard
# against ever accidentally committing a local archive checkout or the raw
# ESP tarballs (each ~1.3GB) into this repo.
wsf_archive_v1.0/
wsf_archive_v*/
DS_espensemble.*.tgz
*.nc

